    "description": "Your natural determination carries you through tough battles. Once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, you can ignore one non <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a>-related effect, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talent\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Talent\">Talent</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill\">Skill</a>, or ability that exceeds your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>. If you spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a>, you can ignore one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mind-Affecting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind-Affecting\">Mind-Affecting</a> effect, even if it is the result of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Technique\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Technique\">Force Technique</a>, or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Secret\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Secret\">Force Secret</a>.",
